  "justification": "Checked by episode title against TVDB series 309823 and TMDB show 66569. The node moves from TVDB 312723 to series 309823. AniDB episode 1-178 (\"海はひとりで遊ぶところ\" (The Sea Is a Place to Play Alone) to \"バラバラをさがそう\" (Episode 178)) are TVDB S1E1 \"The Sea is a Place to Play Alone.\" to TVDB S1E178; AniDB episode 179-319 (\"ボーズくんの家族\" (Episode 179) to \"いいお天気ってうれしいね\" (Episode 319)) have no TVDB episode (TVDB has none of them). Series 309823 Bono Bono carries this 2016 run as season 1: its 178 Japanese titles equal AniDB 1-178 in order. Series 312723 carries only the first 156 by title, so 309823 is the target; TVDB lacks 179-319.",
